---
title: Parallel search in Restate research
summary: Optional anonymous MCP search and fetch feeding the existing research synthesis path.
status: implemented
updated: 2026-10-17
---

The Restate research CLI accepts `--search-provider parallel` for anonymous
[Parallel Search MCP](https://docs.parallel.ai/integrations/mcp/search-mcp).
DuckDuckGo remains the default; `none` skips the web-search node. Selection
belongs in `packages/restate/src/research-pipeline.ts`, with MCP execution behind
the worker's `parallel` handler. Search output remains the `web-search` dependency
consumed by the existing Pi synthesis prompt. Explicit provider failures never
fall back to another service. Workflow identity supplies stable search/fetch
correlation, and the Restate attempt signal and node timeout bound network work.
